# A child's session opens no web page and no link outside a module: they go
# to kidux-closed, which says so in a bubble (D104, docs/dev/session.md,
# section 3). kidux-session puts this directory first in XDG_CONFIG_DIRS.
[Default Applications]
text/html=kidux-closed.desktop
application/xhtml+xml=kidux-closed.desktop
x-scheme-handler/http=kidux-closed.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=kidux-closed.desktop
